WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.160
Your research gave you numbers.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.520
But a number is not yet a decision.

3
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.700
This is how one dimension

4
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.200
turns into an insight.

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.260
As an example, take the first of the eight dimensions,
traffic volume.

6
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.940
It starts with a question.

7
00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.160
Where do we stand against the competition,

8
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.300
and what can we do in light of that?

9
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.640
Then comes the possible value,

10
00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:26.700
which is what you see.

11
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.040
Traffic can be very high, or high, or medium, or low, or zero.

12
00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.620
And last comes the required insight,

13
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.180
which is what you decide.

14
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.640
Traffic volumes in the market and on competitors' sites

15
00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.680
are critical to understanding the market

16
00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.760
and our ability to operate in it.

17
00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:46.820
The third column is what a client pays for.

18
00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.960
There are eight dimensions like this one.

19
00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.660
Now explore them yourself.

